## Proposed change — exactly one file, exactly one addition

File: `docs/product/product.yaml`

Insert a `when:` section into `concepts`, between the existing `given:` and `then:` sections. Add nothing else; change no existing line.

Before (lines 16-24):

```yaml
concepts:
  given:
    - concept: number supplied
